rExtension)\n- [ ] VillagePlacer: mirror PlaceCommand.placeStructure (structure.generate → valid check → force-load bbox chunks → placeInChunk per chunk); pre-check separation (nearest village structure ≥ 128 blocks); CherryfyProcessor ThreadLocal force flag inside try/finally so only this placement is cherryfied\n- [ ] Registrations: SiasWorkshopBlockEntities + SiasWorkshopMenus holders, wired in entrypoint; MenuScreens + property registration in client setup; both items in mod creative tab\n- [ ] Datagen: blockstate/model (lodestone placeholder), loot (dropSelf); lang entries\n- [ ] Build green; user verifies in-game (compass scan + needle, GUI, both flavors, separation refusal, self-gating after success)\n\n## Design decisions (correctable)\n- Block persists after success and becomes inert (BE `generated` flag) — deterministic self-gating, mirrors one-command-one-village semantics.\n- GUI flavors v1: Cherry Blossom / Vanilla. Style picker (plains/snowy/...) and recipe unlocks are follow-ups.\n- Separation threshold hardcoded 128 blocks (villages structure set `separation: 8` chunks) as a named constant.\n\n## Progress Log\n- [2026-10-08T06:15:25.783Z] Created initiative via mdocs command","oldString":"## Objective\n\n\n## Plan\n\n\n## Progress Log\n- [2026-10-08T06:15:25.783Z] Created initiative via mdocs command","path":"mdocs/initiatives/village-tools-wilderness-compass-village-foundation-block--2026-10-08.md"}}}
