ia mdocs command\n- [2026-10-08T17:58:57Z] Researched toolchain + versioning; wiki setup/multi-version-release-notes written; plan recorded.","oldString":"related_wiki: []\n---\n\n## Objective\n\n\n## Plan\n\n\n## Progress Log\n- [2026-10-08T17:56:50.583Z] Created initiative via mdocs command","path":"mdocs/initiatives/multi-version-release-setup-1-20-1-1-21-1--2026-10-08.md"}}}
