{"timestamp":"2026-10-09T15:42:47.111Z","type":"tool","step":"REPORT","details":{"toolName":"bash","args":{"command":"./node_modules/.bin/mdocs command lifecycle.graduate --json '{\"id\":\"finalize-initial-release-1-0-0\",\"sections\":[{\"section\":\"Finalize Initial Release (v1.0.0)\",\"body\":\"Stripped all MDK template leftovers on both branches (example block/item/tab, datagen, generated assets, mods.toml description, lang, README, template zip), replaced the example tab with a real siasworkshop creative tab, and wired the village foundation + wilderness compass to siasworkshop: texture paths with generated stub PNGs (tools/gen_stub_textures.py) plus a designer handoff spec (docs/art/texture-specs.md). Released v1.0.0: created github.com/bbaaxx/siasworkshop, pushed main + version/1.20.1, added a tag-triggered release workflow that builds both branches and publishes both jars to one GitHub Release. CI gotcha fixed: upload-artifact names cannot contain the slash in version/1.20.1 ref_names.\"}],\"logEntry\":\"finalize-initial-release-1-0-0 COMPLETE: v1.0.0 shipped for MC 1.21.1 + 1.20.1; template cleanup, texture stubs + designer spec, dual-branch CI + tag release pipeline all in place.\"}' | head -6 && ./node_modules/.bin/mdocs command initiative.done --json '{\"id\":\"finalize-initial-release-1-0-0\",\"progressNote\":\"All plan items verified: A (template cleanup + placeholders) and B (texture paths + stubs + designer spec) committed on main (e349a6d) and ported to version/1.20.1 (7482533); C: repo created, both branches pushed, branch CI green after artifact-name fix (760b7bd/13a9cea), release workflow published v1.0.0 with both jars.\"}' | head -4 && ./node_modules/.bin/mdocs validate --summary"}}}
