t is fine.\n\nDo NOT change: `Config.AGENTS_DEBUG_INSPECTOR` default, `AgentWorldData` naming, `findNearestFoundation` scan strategy (reviewer only noted it as future work).\n\n## Report back\n\n- Confirmation of each fix (file:line where relevant).\n- New gametest count and `./gradlew build` / `runGameTestServer` results.\n- Any signature changes to the public API surface you reported earlier, as an updated API list.","resume":"agent-0"}}}
