{"timestamp":"2026-10-14T14:57:35.071Z","type":"tool","initiativeId":"agents-v1-decision-pool-goals--2026-10-14","step":"REPORT","details":{"toolName":"edit","args":{"newString":"`SEQ-007 | 2026-10-14 | coordinator | DISCUSS | User pasted a transcribed snapshot sample (~3 scrolls, transcription loss acknowledged). Calibration: observed snapshot ≈ 3× the ~450-token sample → ~1200-1500 tokens, over the 600-900 budget for 4B-class models. Noise confirmed even through OCR: inventory dumps per-slot entries instead of counts; POI lines repeat; action names verbose. Actions folded into agents-v1-decision-pool-goals scope: (0) observation compression pass with caps/knobs + budget gametest; (0.5) verbatim debug output — Inspector writes snapshot to a file on disk (chat transcription is lossy).`\n\n`SEQ-008 | 2026-10-14 | coordinator | RESOLVED | decision-pool-goals slice implemented + reviewed (builder → reviewer → fix cycle). Delivered: pool SavedData (schema v1, LRU cap, tag top-K, trusted≥N), task board (claim/lease/steal, claimant-verified complete/fail, reap 128 resolved), light+shelter detectors, SEQ-007 compression (bottom-up, ~chars/4 estimator, 900-token config default) + Inspector snapshot-to-file under debug/siasworkshop/. Review catch worth remembering: exposure checks must use canSeeSky, NOT getBrightness(SKY)>=15 — at night the latter returns 4 (moonlight) so the check is dead code (now in setup/gametest-notes-1-21-1). Also: lease expiry writes NO pool entry (a timeout is not a plan verdict); GameTest batches isolate time-pinning tests (shared batch world race). 16/16 gametests green. Follow-ups for the LLM initiative: task-execution loop that claims board tasks + cites pool entries via recordSuccess; currentTask() still the \"idle\" stub.`\n\n<!-- Agents: append new entries below this line, in SEQ order. -->","oldString":"`SEQ-007 | 2026-10-14 | coordinator | DISCUSS | User pasted a transcribed snapshot sample (~3 scrolls, transcription loss acknowledged). Calibration: observed snapshot ≈ 3× the ~450-token sample → ~1200-1500 tokens, over the 600-900 budget for 4B-class models. Noise confirmed even through OCR: inventory dumps per-slot entries instead of counts; POI lines repeat; action names verbose. Actions folded into agents-v1-decision-pool-goals scope: (0) observation compression pass with caps/knobs + budget gametest; (0.5) verbatim debug output — Inspector writes snapshot to a file on disk (chat transcription is lossy).`\n\n<!-- Agents: append new entries below this line, in SEQ order. -->","path":"mdocs/wiki/setup/agent-shared-ledger.md"}}}
