{"timestamp":"2026-10-15T02:31:39.768Z","type":"tool","initiativeId":"agents-v1-llm-build-knowledge--2026-10-14","step":"EXECUTE","details":{"toolName":"edit","args":{"newString":"        // The detector scans a radius-8 cube around the player. The roof encloses that volume\n        // from above (no sky cells), and carpet over the outer floor makes it non-rigid\n        // (air-over-carpet is not spawnable), leaving only the small bare-floor room as\n        // lit-able deficit — all of it within the agent's arrival distance, so the test\n        // exercises the executor without depending on long-distance pathfinding.\n        fillBox(helper, new BlockPos(-8, 0, -8), new BlockPos(8, 0, 8), Blocks.STONE, false);\n        fillBox(helper, new BlockPos(-8, 7, -8), new BlockPos(8, 7, 8), Blocks.STONE, false);\n        fillBox(helper, new BlockPos(-8, 1, -8), new BlockPos(8, 1, 8), Blocks.WHITE_CARPET, false);\n        fillBox(helper, new BlockPos(-1, 1, -1), new BlockPos(1, 2, 1), Blocks.STONE, true);\n        for (int x = -1; x <= 1; x++) {\n            for (int z = -1; z <= 1; z++) {\n                helper.setBlock(new BlockPos(x, 1, z), Blocks.AIR);\n            }\n        }","oldString":"        // The detector scans a radius-8 cube around the player; slab + roof fully enclose that\n        // volume so neither sky nor neighbouring test structures create phantom dark spots.\n        // The small sealed room keeps every dark spot within the agent's arrival distance, so\n        // the test exercises the executor without depending on long-distance pathfinding.\n        fillBox(helper, new BlockPos(-8, 0, -8), new BlockPos(8, 0, 8), Blocks.STONE, false);\n        fillBox(helper, new BlockPos(-8, 7, -8), new BlockPos(8, 7, 8), Blocks.STONE, false);\n        fillBox(helper, new BlockPos(-1, 1, -1), new BlockPos(1, 2, 1), Blocks.STONE, true);","path":"src/main/java/com/siaws/siawsmod/gametest/AgentsLlmGameTest.java"}}}
