{"timestamp":"2026-10-15T05:21:20.954Z","type":"tool","initiativeId":"agents-v1-llm-build-knowledge--2026-10-14","step":"EXECUTE","details":{"toolName":"edit","args":{"newString":"    /**\n     * When a task this agent claimed resolves, its citation candidates are consumed: DONE\n     * cites the retrieved entries via {@code pool.recordSuccess} (plan reuse earned the\n     * success); FAILED credits nothing, and the stale retrievals are dropped so they cannot\n     * ride into the agent's next task. Lease sweeps clear the claim without ever reaching\n     * here. The board's own resolution hook writes the outcome entry; this only bumps the\n     * reused entries' success counters.\n     */","oldString":"    /**\n     * When a task this agent claimed resolves DONE, the entries it retrieved when deciding\n     * are cited via {@code pool.recordSuccess} — the plan reuse earned the success. FAILED\n     * resolutions cite nothing (and lease sweeps never reach here: they release the claim).\n     * The board's own resolution hook writes the outcome entry; this only bumps the reused\n     * entries' success counters.\n     */","path":"src/main/java/com/siaws/siawsmod/content/agents/AgentDecisionLoop.java"}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-15T05:21:20.959Z","type":"tool","initiativeId":"agents-v1-llm-build-knowledge--2026-10-14","step":"EXECUTE","details":{"toolName":"edit","args":{"newString":"    /**\n     * When a task this agent claimed resolves, its citation candidates are consumed: DONE\n     * cites the retrieved entries via {@code pool.recordSuccess} (plan reuse earned the\n     * success); FAILED credits nothing, and the stale retrievals are dropped so they cannot\n     * ride into the agent's next task. Lease sweeps clear the claim without ever reaching\n     * here. The board's own resolution hook writes the outcome entry; this only bumps the\n     * reused entries' success counters.\n     */","oldString":"    /**\n     * When a task this agent claimed resolves DONE, the entries it retrieved when deciding\n     * are cited via {@code pool.recordSuccess} — the plan reuse earned the success. FAILED\n     * resolutions cite nothing (and lease sweeps never reach here: they release the claim).\n     * The board's own resolution hook writes the outcome entry; this only bumps the reused\n     * entries' success counters.\n     */","path":"src/main/java/com/siaws/siawsmod/content/agents/AgentDecisionLoop.java"}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-15T05:21:40.118Z","type":"tool","initiativeId":"agents-v1-llm-build-knowledge--2026-10-14","step":"EXECUTE","details":{"toolName":"edit","args":{"newString":"        BlockPos target = findTorchTarget(level, dark, player.blockPosition());\n        if (target == null) {\n            // No valid placement near the nearest spot (sealed cavity, unreachable edge):\n            // holding the claim would deadlock the task forever, so release and let the\n            // deficit re-raise — the world may change, or another agent may fare better.\n            board.release(task.id(), agent.getUUID(), level.getGameTime());\n            agent.setCurrentTaskLabel(\"\");\n            return false;\n        }\n        if (level.setBlock(target, Blocks.TORCH.defaultBlockState(), 3)) {\n            consumeItem(agent, Items.TORCH);\n        }\n        return true;","oldString":"        BlockPos target = findTorchTarget(level, dark, player.blockPosition());\n        if (target == null) {\n            // No valid placement near the nearest spot (sealed cavity, unreachable edge):\n            // holding the claim would deadlock the task forever, so release and let the\n            // deficit re-raise — the world may change, or another agent may fare better.\n            board.release(task.id(), agent.getUUID(), level.getGameTime());\n            agent.setCurrentTaskLabel(\"\");\n            return false;\n        }\n        consumeItem(agent, Items.TORCH);\n        level.setBlock(target, net.minecraft.world.level.block.Blocks.TORCH.defaultBlockState(), 3);\n        return true;","path":"src/main/java/com/siaws/siawsmod/content/agents/AgentDecisionLoop.java"}}}
